  "estudio": "论证与抽象思维·推论与总结",
  "alumno": "Argument and abstract thinking: Inferring and summarising"
 },
 "intro": "HSK 6 unit: study the assigned vocabulary for inferring and summarising, review its pronunciation and check the meanings given by the source. Practise cause and consequence with the structure 因为……所以…….",
 "palabras": [],
 "etapas": [
  {
